  "description": "A walking, talking mannequin. Is this an opportunity to use, or an opportunity to be used? Bo-Ra simply wants a chance to get close to the fashion designer, Hong-Rin Da. Yet it would seem that Hong-Rin wants something more from Bo-Ra. Will Bo-Ra’s struggles to become a fashion designer pull at Hong-Rin’s heartstrings? If she even has any to begin with... \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
